                                                "sense_id": "5832d126-b3d6-34d5-80a5-3a16e751ae68",
                                                "text": "My mother entered my room at that moment; but Mademoiselle went on rallying, and it seemed to me that the subject was not disagreeable even to her."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rallying",
